   *   *   *   *   *
.SS Usage
Once configured, add \f[CR]\-\-notify email\f[R] to any scan:
.IP
.EX
\f[I]# One\-off scan with notification\f[R]
rotbyte \-\-check \-\-notify email /Volumes/Media

\f[I]# Bake it into scheduled scans\f[R]
rotbyte \-\-track \-\-every 1h \-\-full\-at 2h \-\-notify email /Volumes/Media

\f[I]# Email plus healthchecks.io monitoring\f[R]
rotbyte \-\-track \-\-every 1h \-\-full\-at 2h \-\-notify email,healthchecks /Volumes/Media
.EE
.PP
\f[CR]rotbyte \-\-track\-setup\f[R] also asks whether to send email.
.PP
