.PP
\f[B]The email\f[R] is sent as both plain text and a formatted HTML
view.
.PP
The body always includes:
.IP \(bu 2
The host, scan time, and directory.
.IP \(bu 2
A scan summary: verified OK, new, updated, failed, missing, skipped, and
data hashed.
.IP \(bu 2
The scan duration.
.PP
It also includes, when they apply:
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]The change since the previous run\f[R],
e.g.\ \f[CR]bit rot 0 → 2\f[R], which shows a regression or a recovery
at a glance.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]For \f[CB]\-\-due\f[B] scans, progress through the due files.\f[R]
If some are still due, the email says whether the \f[CR]\-\-budget\f[R]
ran out or files couldn\(cqt be read.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]For \f[CB]\-\-due\f[B] scans, overall verification freshness.\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]File paths are never included.\f[R] Email isn\(cqt a private
channel, and the affected paths would sit in your mailbox unencrypted.
When problems are found, the email names the command to run on that
machine to list them:
.IP
.EX
To list the affected files, run this on mac\-mini:
  rotbyte \-\-report /Volumes/Media
Run \(garotbyte \-\-accept <file>\(ga after restoring a file from backup.
.EE
.SS Reconfiguring
Run \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-notify\-setup email\f[R] again at any time to
update your settings.
Only the \f[CR][email]\f[R] section of \f[CR]notify.conf\f[R] is
replaced.
Any healthchecks.io settings are kept.
.PP
To stop emails for a tracked directory, re\-run \f[CR]\-\-track\f[R] for
it without \f[CR]email\f[R] in \f[CR]\-\-notify\f[R].
\f[CR]rotbyte \-\-status\f[R] shows each directory\(cqs current
\f[CR]Notify:\f[R] setting.
.SS Troubleshooting
\f[B]\(lqTesting connection\&...
failed.\(rq\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
Double\-check your app password.
Regular account passwords won\(cqt work.
.IP \(bu 2
Make sure 2FA / two\-step verification is enabled on your account.
.IP \(bu 2
Verify you\(cqre using the correct SMTP host and port for your provider.
.PP
\f[B]Emails going to spam\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
Check your spam/junk folder after the test email.
.IP \(bu 2
Add the sending address to your contacts.
.PP
\f[B]\(lqNo notification config found\(rq or \(lqNo [email]
section\(rq\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
Run \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-notify\-setup email\f[R] to create the config.
.PP
\f[B]Scheduled emails stopped arriving\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
A clean scheduled quick scan doesn\(cqt email, so silence between full
scans is normal.
If full\-scan reports stop too, the schedule itself may have stopped
running:
.RS 2
.IP \(bu 2
Run \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-status\f[R] and look for \f[CR]BROKEN ✗\f[R] or a
failing last run.
.IP \(bu 2
If it looks broken, run \f[CR]rotbyte \-\-repair\f[R].
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
To be alerted automatically next time, add healthchecks.io
(\f[CR]rotbyte \-\-docs healthchecks\f[R]).
